WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.022
The Institutional Malice Doctrine.

00:00:02.022 --> 00:00:11.352
This document proves on the record that political and institutional failures are not the result of incompetence, but of willful, systemic, and intentional malice.

00:00:11.352 --> 00:00:19.284
Five evidence blocks demonstrate that decision-makers are warned before actions, financial conflicts are documented, and policy proceeds anyway.

00:00:19.284 --> 00:00:22.579
ArriveCAN: ninety-three million dollars waste.

00:00:22.579 --> 00:00:27.102
MAID: seventy-six thousand, four hundred and seventy-five deaths.

00:00:27.102 --> 00:00:31.704
C.A.F.: twelve thousand, seven hundred and eighty-five troop shortfall.

00:00:31.704 --> 00:00:36.999
Foreign Influence Registry: zero registrations after six hundred and fifty days.

00:00:36.999 --> 00:00:41.545
P.H.A.C. mandates barred over six million citizens for twenty-two months.

00:00:41.545 --> 00:00:43.465
Incompetence is an alibi.

00:00:43.465 --> 00:00:48.363
The political class relies on the shield of incompetence to excuse systemic failures.

00:00:48.363 --> 00:01:00.136
When documented warnings are given before actions are taken, when financial conflicts align with policy outcomes, and when systemic protections are dismantled while crises are ignored — this is not ignorance.

00:01:00.136 --> 00:01:01.943
It is intentional malice.

00:01:01.943 --> 00:01:03.715
The people have not been overlooked.

00:01:03.715 --> 00:01:05.420
They have been actively targeted.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:08.193
Evidence one: ArriveCAN procurement.

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:11.443
The application was estimated at eighty thousand dollars.

00:01:11.443 --> 00:01:13.454
It cost ninety-three million.

00:01:13.454 --> 00:01:18.693
The primary contractor was a two-person firm operating from a residential home that wrote zero code.

00:01:18.693 --> 00:01:22.249
Seventy-six percent of subcontractors did no work.

00:01:22.249 --> 00:01:27.136
Auditor General reports flagged irregularities while funds continued to be disbursed.

00:01:27.136 --> 00:01:29.863
Evidence two: state-administered death.

00:01:29.863 --> 00:01:34.068
Seventy-six thousand, four hundred and seventy-five MAID deaths.

00:01:34.068 --> 00:01:37.215
One point five eight billion in avoided palliative care.

00:01:37.215 --> 00:01:43.852
The Parliamentary Budget Officer projected one point two seven three trillion in cumulative savings by twenty forty-seven.

00:01:43.852 --> 00:01:50.965
The Prime Minister holds six point eight million in Brookfield options — a company that profits from reduced long-term care demand.

00:01:50.965 --> 00:01:54.340
Evidence three: C.A.F. and veterans betrayal.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:58.102
Twelve thousand, seven hundred and eighty-five troop shortfall.

00:01:58.102 --> 00:02:02.647
Seventy-six percent of military occupations exceed ten percent shortfall.

00:02:02.647 --> 00:02:06.977
Thirty-five point seven billion dollar budget with twenty-nine percent readiness.

00:02:06.977 --> 00:02:14.374
Veterans face eleven thousand claim backlogs, twenty-one week wait times, and over one hundred and fifty million in lapsed funding.

00:02:14.374 --> 00:02:17.079
Evidence four: foreign interference.

00:02:17.079 --> 00:02:24.647
The Hogue Commission confirmed foreign state actors, primarily the P.R.C., are actively interfering in Canadian democratic processes.

00:02:24.647 --> 00:02:28.215
Illegal Chinese police stations operated on Canadian soil.

00:02:28.215 --> 00:02:34.988
The Foreign Influence Transparency Registry has been law for over six hundred and fifty days with zero registrations.

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:40.272
The R.C.M.P. closed investigations into the illegal police stations without laying a single charge.

00:02:40.272 --> 00:02:43.011
Evidence five: P.H.A.C. mandate fraud.

00:02:43.011 --> 00:02:49.704
For twenty-two months, over six million unvaccinated Canadians were banned from domestic air and rail travel.

00:02:49.704 --> 00:02:58.352
Internal P.H.A.C. documents confirmed the mandate had limited epidemiological justification and was designed primarily as a behavioural incentive.

00:02:58.352 --> 00:03:01.159
The Oakes test was failed on all four criteria.

00:03:01.159 --> 00:03:11.249
The government suspended the mandate precisely when the Peckford constitutional challenge reached discovery, then argued the case was moot — preventing any court ruling on constitutionality.
